its subsidiaries, and the consolidated VIEs, or to investors, including the U.S. investors (i.e., there have not been any dividends or
distributions that a subsidiary or consolidated VIEs have made to the holding company, XChange TEC.INC, or to investors, including U.S.
investors). The holding company, XChange TEC.INC, its subsidiaries, and the consolidated VIEs do not have any plans to distribute earnings
or dividends or settle amounts owed under the Contractual Arrangements in the foreseeable future.</span></p><div>

