    <td><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Because the commission revenue we earn on the sale
    of insurance products is based on premium and commission rates set by insurance companies, any decrease in these premiums or commission
    rates, or increase in the referral fees we pay to our external referral sources, may have an adverse effect on our results of operation.</span></td></tr>
