</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">In connection with the Acquisition, we issued
the Notes in an aggregate amount equal to the purchase price to the selling shareholders of Alpha Mind. The Notes, with an outstanding
