Mr. Yong Zhang have agreed to act upon the instructions from the ESOP Operation Committee of the Company, consisting of Yong Zhang and
Jiaxing Chang determined on a unanimous basis in relation to the voting and, prior to the vesting of the shares to the relevant grantee
of the share-based awards under the 2022 Plan, 2024 Plan, and 2025 Plan, the disposition of these Class B ordinary shares. See &#8220;Item
