of its home country. Certain corporate governance practices in the Cayman Islands, which is our home country, may differ significantly
from the NASDAQ Capital Market corporate governance listing standards. Currently, we follow our home country practices and rely on certain
exemptions provided by the NASDAQ Capital Market corporate governance listing standards to a foreign private issuer, including exemptions
from the requirements to have:</span></p><div>

