<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">On June 30,
2025, the Company and the sellers of Alpha Mind agreed to extend the maturity date of the remaining Note and accrued but unpaid interest
