<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">On December 28, 2023, the Company completed the acquisition of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c150" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationStepAcquisitionEquityInterestInAcquireePercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-26327">100</ix:nonFraction>%
