<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">In June 2022,
the Group issued <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c238" decimals="-8" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="9" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-26504">7.2</ix:nonFraction> billion stock options with <span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-238">nil</span> exercise price to Mr. Qu, the Chief Executive Officer of the Company. All of the
