of US$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="7" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-26505">0.0363425</ix:nonFraction>, ADS reverse split in November and December 2023) by reference to the share price in the open market on grant date.</span></p>

